# N1b: demo1 from 17.3 s in Classic, the 1996 look. 320x200 shown 4:3, the status bar and
# the gun, id's recorded camera and its sound (id's mixer, 11025 Hz), Brightness 0.8.
# After the run the player looks up the lift shaft (shot seconds 4.9 to 7.4), and the tail
# fires the nailgun. 8 s with a second of handle each end.
#
# Under V6-18: "One command runs ten checks, six of them against id's own C. All ten
# pass."
#
# Assembly (S27): the terminal over it, listing the ten checks, is the edit's: the six
# against id's C brighten on "against id's own C", and ALL PASS comes up on "All".

demo demo1 from 17.3

duration 10
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud on
gun on
cvar gamma 0.8

sound on
events on
